.TH KULAN-UPDATES 1 "October 2026" "Kulan OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kulan-updates \- open Software Update in Kulan Settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kulan-updates
[\fB\-\-check\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update Center is now part of Kulan Settings.
.B kulan-updates
opens its \fBSoftware Update\fR page, the same as
.BR "kulan-settings updates" .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Check for new updates as soon as the page opens.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kulan-settings (1)
